---

Install this **with** [Spell Codex](/mods/spell-codex) and [Spell Actionbar](/mods/spell-actionbar). All of these are required on NeoForge 1.21.1:

- Iron’s Spells ’n Spellbooks
- Ars Nouveau
- Spell Codex
- Spell Actionbar
- this compat jar

Tomes from Ars and Ars addons are picked up automatically when they use the standard `ars_nouveau:caster_tome` recipe type. You do not register them by hand.
